{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "pg-collection-001",
    "name": "Payment Gateway API",
    "description": "A RESTful payment gateway provider supporting cards, e-wallets, and QR code payments.\n\n## Authentication\nHTTP Basic Auth using `api_key` as username and `api_secret` as password.\n\n## Test Merchants\n| Merchant | api_key | api_secret | Status |\n|----------|---------|------------|--------|\n| Acme Corp | pk_test_acme001 | sk_test_acme001_secret | ACTIVE |\n| Globex | pk_test_globex002 | sk_test_globex002_secret | ACTIVE |\n| Suspended Inc | pk_test_susp005 | sk_test_susp005_secret | SUSPENDED |\n\n## Test Cards\n| Card Number | Behavior |\n|-------------|----------|\n| 4000000000001000 | Visa, no 3DS, always succeeds |\n| 4000000000001091 | Visa, requires 3DS (OTP: 1234) |\n| 4000000000001109 | Visa, 3DS failure |\n| 5200000000001005 | Mastercard, no 3DS |\n| 5200000000001096 | Mastercard, requires 3DS |\n| 4000000000001234 | Invalid Luhn checksum |\n\n## Flow Examples\n1. **Auto-capture card**: POST payment_request with card + capture_method=AUTOMATIC -> SUCCEEDED\n2. **Manual capture**: POST with capture_method=MANUAL -> AUTHORIZED, then POST capture -> SUCCEEDED\n3. **Void**: POST with MANUAL -> AUTHORIZED, then POST void -> VOIDED\n4. **3DS flow**: Use card 4000000000001091 -> REQUIRES_ACTION, complete 3DS challenge with OTP 1234\n5. **E-wallet**: POST with ewallet.channel_code -> REQUIRES_ACTION (ewallet_url)\n6. **QR code**: POST with qr_code.channel_code -> REQUIRES_ACTION (qr_string), simulate scan\n7. **Refund**: After SUCCEEDED payment, POST refund",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      {
        "key": "username",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "password",
        "value": "{{api_secret}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Payment Methods",
      "description": "Tokenize and manage payment methods (cards, e-wallets, QR codes).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Payment Method (Card - No 3DS)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('payment_method_id', jsonData.data.id);",
                  "    pm.test('Payment method created', function() {",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData.data.id).to.match(/^pm-/);",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData.data.status).to.eql('ACTIVE');",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData.data.type).to.eql('CARD');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "description": "Idempotency key"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"CARD\",\n  \"reusability\": \"ONE_TIME_USE\",\n  \"card\": {\n    \"card_number\": \"4000000000001000\",\n    \"expiry_month\": \"12\",\n    \"expiry_year\": \"2028\",\n    \"cvv\": \"123\",\n    \"cardholder_name\": \"John Doe\",\n    \"cardholder_email\": \"john@example.com\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payment_methods",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "payment_methods"]
            },
            "description": "Tokenizes a card that does NOT require 3D Secure. Returns status=ACTIVE immediately."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Payment Method (Card - Requires 3DS)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('payment_method_id', jsonData.data.id);",
                  "    if (jsonData.data.actions && jsonData.data.actions.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('three_ds_challenge_id', jsonData.data.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "    pm.test('Payment method requires 3DS', function() {",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData.data.status).to.eql('PENDING_AUTHENTICATION');",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData.data.actions).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "description": "Idempotency key"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"CARD\",\n  \"reusability\": \"ONE_TIME_USE\",\n  \"card\": {\n    \"card_number\": \"4000000000001091\",\n    \"expiry_month\": \"12\",\n    \"expiry_year\": \"2028\",\n    \"cvv\": \"456\",\n    \"cardholder_name\": \"Jane Smith\",\n    \"cardholder_email\": \"jane@example.com\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payment_methods",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "payment_methods"]
            },
            "description": "Tokenizes a card that requires 3D Secure authentication. Returns status=PENDING_AUTHENTICATION with an action URL for 3DS challenge.\n\nUse OTP `1234` to complete the 3DS challenge."
          },
          "response": []
        },
